{"4350360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fishing Star World Tour", "steam_appid": 4350360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fishing Star World Tour</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing Star World Tour is a game where you can catch over 180 different fish at 40 amazing locations! <br>Each fishing hole is unique with its own fish to catch. So no matter your mood, you'll find a spot to match!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>For Serious Anglers or Fishermen With a Few Free Minutes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw out your lure and reel it in slow to get their attention, and when the time is right, set the hook and let the fight begin!<br>Whether you're hunkering down for a serious time sink or just jumping in for a quick cast—Fishing Star World is a blast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350360/extras/0bba6ec4a2d7387b084ebd1861a9f967.poster.avif?t=1778631082\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350360/extras/0bba6ec4a2d7387b084ebd1861a9f967.webm?t=1778631082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350360/extras/0bba6ec4a2d7387b084ebd1861a9f967.mp4?t=1778631082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Fish in the Sea</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to unique locations with over 180 varieties of fish to find! <br>But beware! <br>Boss fish and legendary catches are out there waiting to put your tackle to the test!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350360/extras/9c8c8577c29adb1d7c8dfe58bbf9dcc8.avif?t=1778631082\" width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Places to Go, Fishes to Catch!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to places inspired by real world locations, you'll find fantastical fishing holes that are literally out of this world! <br>With this much variety, you're ought to find the perfect spot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350360/extras/0c22d66bc8467239f5540679346a2481.avif?t=1778631082\" width=1560 height=584 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Fish Tales Here!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fish you land gets logged, so you can always keep track of what you catch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350360/extras/4a83d5cbe55b7668829873ab77850708.avif?t=1778631082\" width=960 height=540 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fishing Star World Tour</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing Star World Tour is a game where you can catch over 180 different fish at 40 amazing locations! <br>Each fishing hole is unique with its own fish to catch. So no matter your mood, you'll find a spot to match!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>For Serious Anglers or Fishermen With a Few Free Minutes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw out your lure and reel it in slow to get their attention, and when the time is right, set the hook and let the fight begin!<br>Whether you're hunkering down for a serious time sink or just jumping in for a quick cast—Fishing Star World is a blast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350360/extras/0bba6ec4a2d7387b084ebd1861a9f967.poster.avif?t=1778631082\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350360/extras/0bba6ec4a2d7387b084ebd1861a9f967.webm?t=1778631082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350360/extras/0bba6ec4a2d7387b084ebd1861a9f967.mp4?t=1778631082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Fish in the Sea</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to unique locations with over 180 varieties of fish to find! <br>But beware! <br>Boss fish and legendary catches are out there waiting to put your tackle to the test!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350360/extras/9c8c8577c29adb1d7c8dfe58bbf9dcc8.avif?t=1778631082\" width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Places to Go, Fishes to Catch!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to places inspired by real world locations, you'll find fantastical fishing holes that are literally out of this world! <br>With this much variety, you're ought to find the perfect spot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350360/extras/0c22d66bc8467239f5540679346a2481.avif?t=1778631082\" width=1560 height=584 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Fish Tales Here!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fish you land gets logged, so you can always keep track of what you catch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350360/extras/4a83d5cbe55b7668829873ab7785070